Subject: [PATCH 1/8] plugins/screencast: Add scaled window streams and virtual
 desktop streams

Implements stream_window_scaled and stream_desktop from version 7 of zkde_screencast_unstable_v1. A fullscreen 1920x1080 window streamed for a 320x180 thumbnail goes from 8100 KiB to 225 KiB per buffer.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
